                                                "sense_id": "7afb4b70-27ca-3457-baa8-0fbcd7f6f3ca",
                                                "text": "Many mistake my approach as hostile to the sacrosanct memory of J. R. R. Tolkien, undoubtedly one of the greatest worldbuilders of the 20th century and indirectly the father of both a literary and a gaming genre."
